        "TileImage": "$($repository 18324739-f01e-47f4-8c8b-c7f880805491).Image",
        "Description": "Our client, Mr. Zhao, has uncovered an affair between his wife Meifeng and a server at a local restaurant.\r\rMr. Zhao wants it to appear as though the server, Mr. Zeng, shot Meifeng with a long rifle, killed his fellow cooks through workplace sabotage, and committed suicide via jumping from a window. Eliminate Meiling in his stead, dispatch the cooks with an explosion, and send Mr. Zeng falling.\r\rAct quickly and render targets only. Extra bodies or a cooling-off period may prove Zeng innocent.",
